    { heading: "Getting a Colorado Springs project permitted", body: "The Colorado Springs entitlement path runs through the local building department's plan check plus the Colorado Department of Public Health and Environment's physical-plant review — two tracks, two checklists, best engaged in parallel. Early pre-submittal meetings that confirm occupancy classification, sprinkler standard, and submittal requirements compress the timeline more than any drafting acceleration. Apex Grid's senior living practice is built for exactly this: front-loaded decisions, coordinated disciplines, fewer correction cycles." }
