  h1: "Senior Living Engineering in Peoria, IL",
  answer: "Peoria river city with regional medical hub and aging workforce, making it one of Illinois's active senior housing markets. Chicagoland holds one of the Midwest's largest senior populations, and the collar counties keep adding assisted living and memory care as post-war suburbs age. Projects here design to Illinois's requirements through the Illinois Department of Public Health.",
  directAnswer: "Peoria river city with regional medical hub and aging workforce. Senior living projects here follow Illinois licensing through the Illinois Department of Public Health, and Apex Grid Engineering delivers the full MEP, structural, and civil package — from occupancy analysis and entitlements through permit-ready documents, on the fast timelines developers need.",
