  answer: "Mitchell southeast regional center on the I-90 corridor, making it one of South Dakota's active senior housing markets. South Dakota's no-income-tax picture and Sioux Falls's medical hub have pulled retiree in-migration, while the Black Hills draw seasonal and permanent senior residents. Projects here design to South Dakota's requirements through the South Dakota Department of Health.",
  directAnswer: "Mitchell southeast regional center on the I-90 corridor. Senior living projects here follow South Dakota licensing through the South Dakota Department of Health, and Apex Grid Engineering delivers the full MEP, structural, and civil package — from occupancy analysis and entitlements through permit-ready documents, on the fast timelines developers need.",
